<section class="section section--cream">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="text-center" style="max-width:680px;margin:0 auto">
      <span class="section-label">Built in every site</span>
      <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-inline:auto">The qualities every sample shares</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">Behind every visual style, the work is the same.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="principles-grid">
      <div class="principle-card">
        <h3>Scores of 95&ndash;100 on Google's speed test</h3>
        <p>Every sample scores 95 to 100 on Google's speed test and passes its real-visitor check (Core Web Vitals) on phones.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="principle-card">
        <h3>Lean pages</h3>
        <p>Custom code, carefully sized images, and no tracking scripts keep every page light.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="principle-card">
        <h3>Phone-first layouts</h3>
        <p>Each site is designed for the phone first, because more than 70% of visitors use a small screen.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="principle-card">
        <h3>Search-ready structure</h3>
        <p>Clear headings, labels that tell Google you're a local business, and fast load times, built in from the start.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="principle-card">
        <h3>WCAG 2.2 AA accessibility</h3>
        <p>Readable contrast, visible focus outlines, and full keyboard navigation in every build.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="principle-card">
        <h3>A clear next step on every page</h3>
        <p>Every page invites visitors to call, book, request a quote, or email.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

